    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present Lowlands to the market.\r\n\r\nThis impressive five-bedroom detached family home sits on approximately 0.74 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds, privately nestled behind electric gates, mature specimen trees, and privacy hedging. \r\n\r\nThis property also offers the discerning purchaser an opportunity to develop additional residential dwellings on the site subject to the relevant planning permission under Zoning R2 Low/Medium density.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1976 by the current owners, this cherished family residence enjoys a wonderful sense of space, with multi-aspect views that take full advantage of the stunning gardens, optimal sun orientation and serene surroundings. \r\n\r\nOver the years, the property has benefited from numerous energy-efficient upgrades, including solar panels, pumped exterior wall insulation and more. \r\n\r\nAdditional features include a block-built garage with covered carport and electric vehicle charging point.\r\n\r\nAn impressive driveway reveals magnificent gardens to the front and to the rear, a large wood store and car service pit area with seperate own road access also feature.\r\n\r\nAt the house, a bright porch opens into a spacious entrance hall, leading you seamlessly into an open-plan split level living/dining room. \r\n\r\nTo the left of the entrance hall, the kitchen features as the heart of this home with a classic Stanley range cooker, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The kitchen adjoins a snug living room and also benefts from direct access to a beautifully paved courtyard outside.\r\n\r\nThis multi orientation property offers multiple peaceful outdoor spaces, surrounded by lush lawns and mature trees. There are two paved flagstone patios and an elevated deck area to the rear that provide perfect settings for alfresco dining and entertaining with family and friends. \r\n\r\nFive bedrooms add to this substantial home which can be extended even further into the large attic space if desired.\r\n\r\nWith no expense spared in the creation of this wonderful family home and its surroundings McGovern Estates highly recommends viewing of this property.\r\n\r\nLocated on the cusp of both Newtownmountkennedy and the village of Newcastle, 'Lowlands' enjoys a selection of local shops, cafes and amenities, all just a short distance away. Additionally, Druids Glen Golf and Leisure Centre is located just a 5 minute drive. \r\n\r\nA public bus service is just moments from the property providing direct access to Dublin City as well as UCD and Trinity college in under an hour, and the N11/M50 access roads are within easy reach making 'Lowlands' the perfect blend of countryside living and commuter convenience."
      },
